  "body": "Enjoy the best of Browns Bay living in this stylish, low-maintenance home, perfectly suited to busy professionals and those who appreciate comfort, convenience and a relaxed coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nEntertain friends on your sea-view balcony, enjoy drinks in your private courtyard, or stroll into Browns Bay Village for cafés, restaurants, shops and the beach.\r\n\r\nWhat you'll love:\r\n\r\n• Panoramic sea views from the upper-level balcony\r\n• Spacious open-plan living, perfect for entertaining\r\n• 4 bedrooms | 3 bathrooms (Master bedroom with ensuite & walk-in wardrobe)\r\n• Private courtyard for relaxed outdoor living\r\n• Double garage, EV-ready + extra parking\r\n• Secure, gated community with body corporate management\r\n• Easy-care, lock-up-and-leave lifestyle\r\n• Close to Browns Bay Village, beach and coastal walks\r\n\r\nLess maintenance. More lifestyle.\r\n\r\nDiscover the comfort and convenience of belonging to this exclusive coastal community. Get in touch now to organise a viewing. A wonderful opportunity awaits.",
